{
  "id": "EZK.11",
  "number": "11",
  "bookId": "EZK",
  "reference": "Ezekiel 11",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "EZK 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moreover the Spirit lifted me up, and brought me unto the east gate of Jehovah’s house, which looketh eastward: and behold, at the door of the gate five and twenty men; and I saw in the midst of them Jaazaniah the son of Azzur, and Pelatiah the son of Benaiah, princes of the people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he said unto me, Son of man, these are the men that devise iniquity, and that give wicked counsel in this city; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that say, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is not near to build houses: this ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is the caldron, and we are the flesh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore prophesy against them, prophesy, O son of man.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Spirit of Jehovah fell upon me, and he said unto me, Speak, Thus saith Jehovah: Thus have ye said, O house of Israel; for I know the things that come into your mind. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye have multiplied your slain in this city, and ye have filled the streets thereof with the slain. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore thus saith the Lord Jehovah: Your slain whom ye have laid in the midst of it, they are the flesh, and this ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " is the caldron; but ye shall be brought forth out of the midst of it. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye have feared the sword; and I will bring the sword upon you, saith the Lord Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will bring you forth out of the midst thereof, and deliver you into the hands of strangers, and will execute judgments among you. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ye shall fall by the sword; I will judge you in the border of Israel; and ye shall know that I am Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " shall not be your caldron, neither shall ye be the flesh in the midst thereof; I will judge you in the border of Israel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and ye shall know that I am Jehovah: for ye have not walked in my statutes, neither have ye executed mine ordinances, but have done after the ordinances of the nations that are round about you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And it came to pass, when I prophesied, that Pelatiah the son of Benaiah died. Then fell I down upon my face, and cried with a loud voice, and said, Ah Lord Jehovah! wilt thou make a full end of the remnant of Israel?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the word of Jehovah came unto me, saying, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Son of man, thy brethren, even thy brethren, the men of thy kindred, and all the house of Israel, all of them, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " unto whom the inhabitants of Jerusalem have said, Get you far from Jehovah; unto us is this land given for a possession. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore say, Thus saith the Lord Jehovah: Whereas I have removed them far off among the nations, and whereas I have scattered them among the countries, yet will I be to them a sanctuary for a little while in the countries where they are come. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore say, Thus saith the Lord Jehovah: I will gather you from the peoples, and assemble you out of the countries where ye have been scattered, and I will give you the land of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And they shall come thither, and they shall take away all the detestable things thereof and all the abominations thereof from thence. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I will give them one heart, and I will put a new spirit within you; and I will take the stony heart out of their flesh, and will give them a heart of flesh; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "that they may walk in my statutes, and keep mine ordinances, and do them: and they shall be my people, and I will be their God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But as for them whose heart walketh after the heart of their detestable things and their abominations, I will bring their way upon their own heads, saith the Lord Jehovah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then did the cherubim lift up their wings, and the wheels were beside them; and the glory of the God of Israel was over them above. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the glory of Jehovah went up from the midst of the city, and stood upon the mountain which is on the east side of the city. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the Spirit lifted me up, and brought me in the vision by the Spirit of God into Chaldea, to them of the captivity. So the vision that I had seen went up from me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then I spake unto them of the captivity all the things that Jehovah had showed me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
